            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the PR!\r\n\r\nThe current formatting is intentional. Each module is called that way because it is indeed a Lua module of 'mini.nvim' library. Using them this way is recommended.\r\n\r\nThe links in this PR go to standalone repositories for each module, which is a secondary form of their distribution. Having their names mentioned in module READMEs should be enough.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
